<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Southwest Air raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Southwest Air raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co LLC said it upgraded Southwest Airlines Co to &quot;outperform long-term&quot; from &quot;outperform speculative.&quot;</p>
<p>-- said upgraded the stock to reflect the high quality of finances, operations and management.</p>
<p>-- Southwest gained 1/8 to 23-1/4.</p>
</text>
